      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T05:59:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The overhead of this is still relatively big. In a previous patch I was suggesting having a single sparse array and a perfect mapping (netId, slot) → int key (e.g. netId * 2¹⁶ + slot). It would also simplify the code a fair bit in many places.",
