      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T05:59:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is all ints, so just have your IDE generate this. It will generate something like 2 * carrierId + 3 * transportTypes + 5 * intervalMsec, which is considerably better than this because Objects.hash will box all three ints, call .hashCode on each of them which returns them and add them together, so that\u0027s very expensive for a very poor hash.",
