      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T05:59:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you factorize this ? e.g.\n\n    private void onKeepaliveActive(network, slot, bool active) {\n      final int netId \u003d network.netId;\n      if (!isKnownKeepalive(netId, slot)) {\n        Log.e(TAG, \"Attempt to set active keepalive on an unknown network, slot pair\");\n        return;\n      }\n      final long timeNow \u003d mDependencies.getUptimeMillis();\n      updateDurationsPerNumOfKeepalive(timeNow);\n\n      mNumActiveKeepalive +\u003d active ? 1 : -1;\n      mKeepaliveStatsPerNetwork\n              .get(netId)\n              .get(slot)\n              .updateLifetimeStatsAndSetActive(timeNow, active);\n    }\n\n    public void onPauseKeepalive(network, slot) {\n      onKeepaliveActive(network, slot, false);\n    }\n    public void onResumeKeepalive(network, slot) {\n      onKeepaliveActive(network, slot, true);\n    }",
